=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不；没有；无；非；不需要；不允许</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229314\">イエスかノーかはっきりしろ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">说是还是不是</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">はあ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">是的；确实；嗯；哈！；什么？；嗯？；（叹息）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75572\">・・・はぁ、どう<ruby>状況<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>受<rp>(</rp><rt>う</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>け<ruby>止<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めればいいのかしら。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">...我该怎么应付这个呢?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">灰</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">はい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">灰；灰烬</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214381\">すべては<ruby>燃<rp>(</rp><rt>も</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えて<ruby>灰<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>となった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一切都被烧成灰烬了。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/361662\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ハイキング</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\